        <mxCell id="nkH-O_3KEUESGwIoCjPI-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;States describe conversation move standing at a recorded conversation point. Example: an Outcome that resolves an Issue supports a Resolved state at that point. Addressed alone does not imply Resolved; an individual position does not establish group selection or rejection. ExpressedPosition and Outcome have no states in this model. (&lt;b&gt;CQs 1, 2 and 4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
